  "bindings": {
    "author_context_snapshot_digest": "4dd96473e0c0674dceb1dd5ccd73902d871d93c8cdab8f45614f64535cd434b0",
    "author_context_version": 0,
    "draft_id": "draft-9951c5d3-e78e-48ae-be4e-f6af3b411f5f",
    "draft_revision": 2,
    "memory_version": 4,
    "project_id": "prj-dba06c2e-8348-4399-aeec-4b5ce30f49bc",
    "source_revision": 1
  },
  "selected_source_bindings": [
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-9951c5d3-e78e-48ae-be4e-f6af3b411f5f-r2-1",
      "text": "昨日温岚尚未得知银钥匙的用途。",
      "sha256": "d71edf60ed15d4ff1e5b78fe3436b750ce72618b808cd2b2905357b218561c4f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-9951c5d3-e78e-48ae-be4e-f6af3b411f5f-r2-2",
      "text": "今日她读完陈澈的信，才知道银钥匙能打开潮汐档案柜。",
      "sha256": "41c96c66ec39c27477c97b125f46eae2766e676240244fbe12808e6b265c9829"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-bb94905e-13dd-4471-b66c-d61dc8c3b364",
      "chapter_id": "ch-b766ee0a-2da0-480f-84ec-346bd41d3879",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-483c2206-f94f-44f3-884f-c1c030ce4fc0",
      "chapter_id": "ch-28deb150-4d3c-42e0-9ba1-bca8f7c7d9c0",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-780b53ee-5885-4bd9-97d7-44944e26292e",
      "chapter_id": "ch-fc9e9760-6f19-4ceb-bf4e-7d3beabde902",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-5f48e5cf-783d-4ae2-8878-11b3be89ca2a",
      "chapter_id": "ch-b53a0a0e-6a92-4459-936b-72f412f7b8c7",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-dfaad0da-2a31-4c2a-a4bb-4f2af71c9343",
      "source_span_id": "span-bb94905e-13dd-4471-b66c-d61dc8c3b364",
      "text": "廊桥钥匙的含义",
      "sha256": "3d99a1a224bc211b22a638a8f187cd974662fc52736efc569d231bb77aa798ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-e21570d1-1788-4f08-a9f5-d6a381ebd0c0",
      "source_span_id": "span-780b53ee-5885-4bd9-97d7-44944e26292e",
      "text": "温岚",
      "sha256": "2fdb67447992579f8f9f0c751e36d69fbcaba84c43b2318b010edec750ef1c1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-1f84bc33-d5d3-403b-be4b-cb2d61881315",
      "source_span_id": "span-dca0f0c7-748d-47d6-a7f1-f5c63a1c2e91",
      "text": "没有靠岸，来源未明",
      "sha256": "79fd506cc2927825ff3684e1a00e8fa6f5e8e841cc8d31f5cd4f5f81b1f23b1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-38eedf80-4457-48d3-b830-060eedb531f1",
      "source_span_id": "span-c287ebaf-4e4b-495a-b25c-7cea6a6b6a81",
      "text": "只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次",
      "sha256": "b1d239266968026fc4ef7041f32af6dabaff05fb624ba424e4693ea98dc124b5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-58d9a24f-0895-485e-97d1-29b594c9a3db",
      "source_span_id": "span-3019164f-4fa6-463d-ac9a-446414edfe84",
      "text": "第6章 21:05 收到三次求救码",
      "sha256": "7556dfa1c21c2596152b98090557914768c4a70b2db0c1c03ce3d6a93349e316"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-bbc41359-d694-44aa-aa17-0298ef85c3f1",
      "source_span_id": "span-483c2206-f94f-44f3-884f-c1c030ce4fc0",
      "text": "北潮闸未关闭时响起，原因未解",
      "sha256": "5a1ecc11587f240902b67617d5fcba571f254dc1dff4ddacd9b13321ea989b70"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-dee315de-b77e-4ea0-8a14-b44c9504744b",
